/Title (3. MultiEarth 2022 \(Train/Evaluate\)  A four-sensor dataset \(Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Landsat-5, Landsat-8\) co-registered over the Amazon rainforest, with deforestation labels. Its four aligned sensors give six possible sensor-pair combinations, making it the only dataset able to support a genuine leave-one-pair-out generalization test. Also used as a second, independent downstream segmentation task.)
